{"title":"Career Roadmap: Interior Design Visualiser","role":"Interior Design Visualiser","summary":"An Interior Design Visualiser converts interior-design concepts, drawings and specifications into convincing 2D/3D visual representations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (General / Honours)","Course":"Interior Design"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build strong skills in spatial design, 3D modelling, materials, lighting, rendering and visual presentation"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Interior Design Visualiser converts interior-design concepts, drawings and specifications into convincing 2D/3D visual representations."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical outputs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D interior models"},{"text":"Photorealistic renders"},{"text":"Walkthroughs"},{"text":"360° panoramas"},{"text":"Material visualizations"},{"text":"Lighting studies"},{"text":"Mood visuals"},{"text":"Furniture layouts"},{"text":"Presentation boards"},{"text":"Animation/video walkthroughs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Design","3D Modelling","Materials","Lighting","Rendering","Composition","Technical Drawing","Visualization"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Drawing, space planning, colour, materials"},{"text":"Hand sketches + layouts"},{"text":"Only learning software"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"SketchUp/3ds Max/Blender"},{"text":"Interior models"},{"text":"Poor modelling fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Rendering + visualization"},{"text":"V-Ray/Corona/Enscape/D5/Unreal"},{"text":"Photorealistic renders"},{"text":"Weak lighting/materials"}],[