"},{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Project planning"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Creative direction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative Director"},{"text":"Visualization Director"},{"text":"3D Studio Head"},{"text":"Design Technology Lead"},{"text":"Visualization Consultant"},{"text":"Independent Visualization Studio Owner"}]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Interior visualization is moving toward real-time, interactive and AI-assisted design."},{"type":"p","text":"Important developments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted 3D modelling"},{"text":"AI material generation"},{"text":"Automated scene creation"},{"text":"Real-time rendering"},{"text":"Virtual reality"},{"text":"Augmented reality"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Interactive configurators"},{"text":"Procedural design"},{"text":"Parametric interiors"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"AI-assisted post-production"},{"text":"Virtual staging"},{"text":"Immersive property marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI may automate parts of basic visualization, so the stronger long-term profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design understanding","3D expertise","photorealism","real-time engines","client communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than simply knowing how to produce a basic render."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Interior styles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"Revit fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3D"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SketchUp or 3ds Max/Blender"},{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"UVs"},{"text":"Texturing"},{"text":"Asset management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"V-Ray/Corona"},{"text":"Enscape/D5/Twinmotion"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Camera"},{"text":"Photorealism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Post-Production"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"After Effects/Premiere basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"VR"},{"text":"Real-time visualization"},{"text":"AI-assisted visualization"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complete residential interior project"},{"text":"Commercial interior project"},{"text":"Luxury interior project"},{"text":"Photorealistic rendering portfolio"},{"text":"3D furniture/material study"},{"text":"Day/night lighting study"},{"text":"360° or interactive walkthrough"},{"text":"Real-time visualization project"},{"text":"Industry internship"},{"text":"Professional online portfolio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Interior Design → Design Fundamentals → Technical Drawing → AutoCAD → Space Planning → 3D Modelling → SketchUp/3ds Max/Blender → Materials & Texturing → Lighting → V-Ray/Corona/Enscape → Photoshop → Real-Time Visualization → Internship → Junior Visualiser → Interior Design Visualiser → Senior Visualiser → Visualization Specialist → Art/Creative Director."}]}]}